<title>HONG KONG: CNPC (HK) interim net loss HK$5.77 mln.</title>
<headline>CNPC (HK) interim net loss HK$5.77 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.21 loss vs 0.22 loss (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	 vs 1.29 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    5.77 loss vs 6.08 loss (see note)</p>
<p>    Turnover		     13.50     vs 7.20</p>
<p>    Company name		 CNPC (Hong Kong) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - CNPC (Hong Kong) is an oil explorer.</p>
<p>The operating loss for the corresponding period has been re-stated to reflect the change in accounting policy relating to the amortisation of the Thai Oil Concession effected in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
